# Test PractiMatch Waitlist API

### ========================================
### STEP 1: PUBLIC ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Root endpoint
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

### Register new user in waitlist (Student)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "user_type": "student",
  "product_of_interest": "PractiMatch Platform",
  "source": "Instagram",
  "country": "Mexico"
}

### Register duplicate email (should increment counter)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "user_type": "student",
  "product_of_interest": "PractiMatch Platform",
  "source": "Facebook",
  "country": "Mexico"
}

### Register company
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "company@example.com",
  "user_type": "company",
  "product_of_interest": "Recruitment Tool",
  "source": "Direct"
}

### Register university (without optional fields)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "university@example.com",
  "user_type": "university",
  "product_of_interest": "Academic Partnership"
}

### ========================================
### STEP 2: ADMIN ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 1. Login como admin
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@practimatch.com",
  "password": "your-secure-password"
}

### 2. Get current admin info (usar token del paso anterior)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <COPIAR_TOKEN_AQUI>

### 3. Get waitlist (primera página)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/admin/waitlist?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer <COPIAR_TOKEN_AQUI>

### 4. Get waitlist filtrado por tipo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/admin/waitlist?page=1&limit=10&user_type=student
Authorization: Bearer <COPIAR_TOKEN_AQUI>

### 5. Get waitlist por fuente
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/admin/waitlist?page=1&limit=10&source=Instagram
Authorization: Bearer <COPIAR_TOKEN_AQUI>

### 6. Buscar por email
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/admin/waitlist?page=1&limit=10&email=student
Authorization: Bearer <COPIAR_TOKEN_AQUI>

### 7. Ordenar por registration_count
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/admin/waitlist?page=1&limit=10&order_by=registration_count_desc
Authorization: Bearer <COPIAR_TOKEN_AQUI>

### 8. Get metrics
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/admin/metrics
Authorization: Bearer <COPIAR_TOKEN_AQUI>

### 9. Test sin autenticación (debe fallar 401)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/admin/waitlist

### 10. Test con token inválido (debe fallar 401)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/admin/waitlist
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here
